---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/layout/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Copyright Policy & DMCA Takedown Notice | StuddyBuddy"
  description="StuddyBuddy Copyright and Takedown Policy. How rights holders can report infringing academic material for immediate review and removal."
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-8">
    <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Copyright & DMCA Takedown Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Expedited Takedown Procedure</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Notice to Copyright Holders</h2>
        <p>
          StuddyBuddy respects intellectual property rights. If you believe your copyrighted work or proprietary institutional academic content has been uploaded to our platform without authorization, we provide an expedited takedown request process.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Submitting a Takedown Notice</h2>
        <p>
          To expedite content review and removal, please submit a report with the following details:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>The specific URL(s) of the resource on StuddyBuddy (e.g. <code>https://studdybuddy.in/resources/...</code>).</li>
          <li>Identification of the copyrighted work claimed to have been infringed.</li>
          <li>Your contact information (name, institutional affiliation, email address).</li>
          <li>A statement of good faith belief that the disputed use is unauthorized by the copyright owner.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/60 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-800 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-indigo-900 dark:text-indigo-200">Submit a Takedown Request</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-indigo-800 dark:text-indigo-300">
          You can submit a notice directly via our contact form or email our moderation team. Valid requests are reviewed and acted upon promptly.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/contact?subject=DMCA+Takedown+Request"
          class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold shadow-sm"
        >
          Submit Takedown Form →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>
